Now responsive canvas: set canvas width/height based on devicePixelRatio. Use CSS to make it fill container. We'll set canvas style width:100%; height:100%; and then in JS set canvas.width = canvas.clientWidth * dpr, canvas.height = canvas.clientHeight * dpr, then scale context.

